# Policy DSL

- Author policies in product YAML, never engine-specific Rego.
- Every published policy needs fixtures under `policies/fixtures/` with expected ALLOW/DENY/REQUIRE_APPROVAL.
- Precedence: explicit DENY > REQUIRE_APPROVAL > ALLOW > fallback DENY.
- Conditions use `field` / `op` / `value` or `all` / `any`. Missing fields fail the condition.
- Add a unit test when adding an operator or changing precedence.
